{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/f1696f2818e77fc38602342c81a7e7b3.poster.avif?t=1758013970\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/f1696f2818e77fc38602342c81a7e7b3.webm?t=1758013970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/f1696f2818e77fc38602342c81a7e7b3.mp4?t=1758013970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RESEED</strong> is a precision platformer that tests both your skill and your memory. Your goal: guide each seed safely to the end of the level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The twist? While planning your route, the traps are hidden. You will need to remember their locations from memory and plan a safe path if you want the seed to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/24aebf0f01eee553415f2583ddb93516.webp?t=1758013970\" width=616 height=44 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan the level and learn the layout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/c36df8aaa656d8a034418bc6be9612db.poster.avif?t=1758013970\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/c36df8aaa656d8a034418bc6be9612db.webm?t=1758013970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/c36df8aaa656d8a034418bc6be9612db.mp4?t=1758013970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/a1116bd67469ff27ebec9836bafcecbd.webp?t=1758013970\" width=616 height=44 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   Remember where the traps are hidden and map out a safe path entirely from memory so the seed can reach the goal unharmed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/4d61ba56eb9b48cefeffd5f4ba37961d.poster.avif?t=1758013970\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/4d61ba56eb9b48cefeffd5f4ba37961d.webm?t=1758013970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/4d61ba56eb9b48cefeffd5f4ba37961d.mp4?t=1758013970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/848a9300114206a65ec099768a2ae0e9.webp?t=1758013970\" width=616 height=44 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as the seed faithfully follows your planned route\u2026 for better or worse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/e931ca780c66e4fb251de37b8405e8a3.poster.avif?t=1758013970\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/e931ca780c66e4fb251de37b8405e8a3.webm?t=1758013970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/e931ca780c66e4fb251de37b8405e8a3.mp4?t=1758013970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fail, Learn, Repeat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting it right the first time won\u2019t be easy. Learn from every mistake, refine your memory, and perfect your route.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save them all!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue every seed and return them to your ship to complete your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/3ccb92ea18cd893665ba514306f4d188.poster.avif?t=1758013970\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/3ccb92ea18cd893665ba514306f4d188.apng?t=1758013970\" class=\"bb_img\" width=115 height=137 /></picture></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954440?t=1758013970","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/fc75090e2ecf8161a297e559e1ee6aa7646a6e53/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758013970","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/631850ea67016a6bcd6621a43569adfcdeda0a10/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758013970","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/631850ea67016a6bcd6621a43569adfcdeda0a10/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758013970","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><spa